---
// ABOUTME: Checkbox under an output field that turns word splitting of decrypted text on or off.
// ABOUTME: Behaviour lives in word-split.ts; the form's script wires it to its output.
// SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Michel Oosterhof
// SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
---

<label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
  <input
    data-word-split
    type="checkbox"
    checked
    class="h-4 w-4 accent-orange-600"
  />
  Split into words
  <span class="text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500">
    (adds spaces when the result reads as English)
  </span>
</label>
